(6271473, 928097, 117534, '<td valign="top">I am always in awe of windmill pixs, because I have nothing around me so nice to photograph.. So I have to sit and study these because I tend to go ooo ahh and award a big score, But, after sitting and studying this I STILL have to award a big score. This photo feels alive, it pulls me in, the more I look the more I like it! 9 and good luck to you</td>', 'I am always in awe of windmill pixs, because I have nothing around me so nice to photograph.. So I have to sit and study these because I tend to go ooo ahh and award a big score, But, after sitting and studying this I STILL have to award a big score. This photo feels alive, it pulls me in, the more I look the more I like it! 9 and good luck to you', '2011-01-05 00:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
