(6272600, 928352, 115307, '<td valign="top">I am very intrigued by this photograph. I can''t stop staring at it.<br/>The reference of shadow makes me think this wasn''t shot against the light, but since I really don''t know what I am looking at, I am giving you the benefit of the doubt. 7</td>', 'I am very intrigued by this photograph. I can''t stop staring at it.The reference of shadow makes me think this wasn''t shot against the light, but since I really don''t know what I am looking at, I am giving you the benefit of the doubt. 7', '2011-01-05 19:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6272603, 928385, 115307, '<td valign="top">The shapes of these birds is very nice and interesting, but the tree in the middle is such an eye sore. Without that tree this would have been a way stronger image.<br/>I wish you could have done a super super tight crop of just the birds on the left (I acknowledge that that was probably not actually possible quality wise, thats just what I wish).</td>', 'The shapes of these birds is very nice and interesting, but the tree in the middle is such an eye sore. Without that tree this would have been a way stronger image.I wish you could have done a super super tight crop of just the birds on the left (I acknowledge that that was probably not actually possible quality wise, thats just what I wish).', '2011-01-05 19:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6272609, 927808, 115307, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this photo boring at all. I think that the very narrow depth of focus is quite interesting.<br/>It honestly saddens me that you should think so. It is hard to value a photograph that the photographer clearly does not value. I am going to pretend that I never saw the title, and give this photo a 7<br/>I don''t know what your score is looking like right now, but if it is not high then I really believe your title is to blame.</td>', 'I don''t find this photo boring at all. I think that the very narrow depth of focus is quite interesting.It honestly saddens me that you should think so. It is hard to value a photograph that the photographer clearly does not value. I am going to pretend that I never saw the title, and give this photo a 7I don''t know what your score is looking like right now, but if it is not high then I really believe your title is to blame.', '2011-01-05 19:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6272611, 927162, 115307, '<td valign="top">Ahahahaha, I love the whiskers! So many photographs in this challenge just mindlessly face the subject so that it is being shot against the light. This is one of the few where doing so actually brings out a different perspective and new interesting details. Well done. 8</td>', 'Ahahahaha, I love the whiskers! So many photographs in this challenge just mindlessly face the subject so that it is being shot against the light. This is one of the few where doing so actually brings out a different perspective and new interesting details. Well done. 8', '2011-01-05 19:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6272616, 928402, 115307, '<td valign="top">I have been sitting here for a while, trying to find the words to describe this photograph, and I just can''t.<br/>The play of light is breathtakingly beautiful, and robs me of all words. Instant 10 and a fav, and I sincerely hope another commenter comes along that can express the beauty of this photo in more eloquent ways.<br/>"The Silence is Deafening" comes to mind.<br/>Its so funny to me that this looks like absolutely nothing as a thumbnail</td>', 'I have been sitting here for a while, trying to find the words to describe this photograph, and I just can''t.The play of light is breathtakingly beautiful, and robs me of all words. Instant 10 and a fav, and I sincerely hope another commenter comes along that can express the beauty of this photo in more eloquent ways."The Silence is Deafening" comes to mind.Its so funny to me that this looks like absolutely nothing as a thumbnail', '2011-01-05 20:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6272651, 928221, 16148, '<td valign="top">Great use of contre-joir in this candid beach scene.  Your image has a natural unforced quality that should score very well.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great use of contre-joir in this candid beach scene.  Your image has a natural unforced quality that should score very well.  Good luck!', '2011-01-05 20:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
