(6273072, 927555, 113156, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture of an everyday event, love how the cloud frames the couple, the church spire (think that''s what it is) is slightly distracting but its a minor element in an otherwise super photo.</td>', 'Amazing capture of an everyday event, love how the cloud frames the couple, the church spire (think that''s what it is) is slightly distracting but its a minor element in an otherwise super photo.', '2011-01-06 05:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
