(6273079, 928219, 113156, '<td valign="top">I''m not into flower shots normally but this has a certain je ne sais quoi, maybe the tones, maybe the light, most probably both, like it anyway.</td>', 'I''m not into flower shots normally but this has a certain je ne sais quoi, maybe the tones, maybe the light, most probably both, like it anyway.', '2011-01-06 05:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273080, 927226, 113156, '<td valign="top">I''m sensing maybe England here don''t know why, anyway you''ve made a very mundane normal scene into a very nice photo, its not a photo that jumps out &amp; grabs you but a photo that requires a certain mood to be appreciated, bravo.</td>', 'I''m sensing maybe England here don''t know why, anyway you''ve made a very mundane normal scene into a very nice photo, its not a photo that jumps out & grabs you but a photo that requires a certain mood to be appreciated, bravo.', '2011-01-06 05:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273082, 928112, 113156, '<td valign="top">This is maybe the best leaf shot i''ve ever seen, i also like the way you added the borders. Great.</td>', 'This is maybe the best leaf shot i''ve ever seen, i also like the way you added the borders. Great.', '2011-01-06 05:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273155, 928163, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice street scene. Your composition is just excellent, at least for me. Your perpendicular lines are squared off, the traffic light comes to a satisfying close within the frame, the girl on the left isn''t cut off, the leading lines of the grid take your eyes into the light and the action. And it wouldn''t be the holidays in NYC without Macy''s. Tones are excellent. The whole thing is extremely well balanced. This isn''t lucky street photography. This is something special. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice street scene. Your composition is just excellent, at least for me. Your perpendicular lines are squared off, the traffic light comes to a satisfying close within the frame, the girl on the left isn''t cut off, the leading lines of the grid take your eyes into the light and the action. And it wouldn''t be the holidays in NYC without Macy''s. Tones are excellent. The whole thing is extremely well balanced. This isn''t lucky street photography. This is something special. Well done.', '2011-01-06 07:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273157, 927059, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Wonderful exposure, well spotted, some nice bokeh. Has a nice circular flow to it, and as the eye moves around and out it picks up more detail and glints of light. Great.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Wonderful exposure, well spotted, some nice bokeh. Has a nice circular flow to it, and as the eye moves around and out it picks up more detail and glints of light. Great.', '2011-01-06 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6273162, 928187, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. The crop is a bit awkward for presentation here on DPC but I end up having to do this all the time so I can relate. Love the idea, and the fact that there are faint traces of color to the edge of the frame.</td>', 'Very nice image. The crop is a bit awkward for presentation here on DPC but I end up having to do this all the time so I can relate. Love the idea, and the fact that there are faint traces of color to the edge of the frame.', '2011-01-06 08:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
