(6273203, 928097, 12405, '<td valign="top">yet another well done sunset, where there is more to look at than the sunset and the clouds. The contrast of the plants and the windmills really makes this shot for me. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'yet another well done sunset, where there is more to look at than the sunset and the clouds. The contrast of the plants and the windmills really makes this shot for me. Thanks for sharing.', '2011-01-06 09:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
