(6280132, 928348, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Almost too harsh at first but it truly represents a wonderful range of tones. Cool photo. Bokeh is awesome.</td>', 'Very nice. Almost too harsh at first but it truly represents a wonderful range of tones. Cool photo. Bokeh is awesome.', '2011-01-11 17:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
