(6280151, 928402, 108069, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too harsh I think. The plants in the back remind me of amoebas. Nice composition, but I would like it more if it were warmer and more subtle.</td>', 'Just a bit too harsh I think. The plants in the back remind me of amoebas. Nice composition, but I would like it more if it were warmer and more subtle.', '2011-01-11 17:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
