(6280155, 927629, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Composition, tones, the story, the glint off the snow. Even definition of the hills in the distance. Outstanding.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Composition, tones, the story, the glint off the snow. Even definition of the hills in the distance. Outstanding.', '2011-01-11 17:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
