(6280435, 927909, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great deep color. I like the little hints of light, they add a bit of life to the photo.<br/> <br/>EDIT: So sometimes, if I leave DPC and return later, it puts the comment I added for a different photo as the comment on some other photo. I''m not at all sure why it does that. But luckily, this comment could be somewhat applied to this photo as well. The hints of light are on the snow, and the color  is in the trees.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-01-12 08:45:45.</i></td>', 'Great deep color. I like the little hints of light, they add a bit of life to the photo. EDIT: So sometimes, if I leave DPC and return later, it puts the comment I added for a different photo as the comment on some other photo. I''m not at all sure why it does that. But luckily, this comment could be somewhat applied to this photo as well. The hints of light are on the snow, and the color  is in the trees.', '2011-01-11 21:51:48.000000', '2011-01-12 08:45:45.000000', 1),
