(6280711, 927240, 93565, '<td valign="top">Your model looks less than pleased to be party to the photo ;)<br/>To me, this shot has light that would be suitable for a contre-jour shot, but doesn''t take advantage of it and use it in a constructive fashion- it''s just sorta there. Visually, this light doesn''t bear weight, or impact, and seems superfluous; matter of fact.</td>', 'Your model looks less than pleased to be party to the photo ;)To me, this shot has light that would be suitable for a contre-jour shot, but doesn''t take advantage of it and use it in a constructive fashion- it''s just sorta there. Visually, this light doesn''t bear weight, or impact, and seems superfluous; matter of fact.', '2011-01-12 00:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
