(6280728, 927808, 93565, '<td valign="top">I agree with this being a pretty cool shot. The shadows already add a lot, but it seems like they could have been made a bit more prominent to strengthen things. The shallow depth of field works interestingly with the shadows, in any case. You''ve got an interesting battle between leading lines and sharp, small details fighting it out.</td>', 'I agree with this being a pretty cool shot. The shadows already add a lot, but it seems like they could have been made a bit more prominent to strengthen things. The shallow depth of field works interestingly with the shadows, in any case. You''ve got an interesting battle between leading lines and sharp, small details fighting it out.', '2011-01-12 00:29:39.000000', NULL, 0),
