(6449312, 928391, 23484, '<td valign="top">This image is absolutely amazing!  I don''t know why you got the scores that you did.  I didn''t vote in this challenge but I would have probably given this an 8.  One thing you have to notice is that you also received a lot of 9''s and 10''s which means that many people did like it.  I think the most fascinating images are the ones that are higher than average on the ends.  To me, that means you really struck a chord with the voters. Just my opinion.  Good job.</td>', 'This image is absolutely amazing!  I don''t know why you got the scores that you did.  I didn''t vote in this challenge but I would have probably given this an 8.  One thing you have to notice is that you also received a lot of 9''s and 10''s which means that many people did like it.  I think the most fascinating images are the ones that are higher than average on the ends.  To me, that means you really struck a chord with the voters. Just my opinion.  Good job.', '2011-06-21 14:35:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6477693, 928391, 12611, '<td valign="top">Super good; love the orange tones and the placement of the trees; the yellow is a nice transition upward to green and white. Great intense focus point where white meets the wishbone tree, great shot.</td>', 'Super good; love the orange tones and the placement of the trees; the yellow is a nice transition upward to green and white. Great intense focus point where white meets the wishbone tree, great shot.', '2011-07-21 12:51:24.000000', NULL, 0);
